### CodeAssistAI sample requests
### Requires: uvicorn app.main:app --reload

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create review (division by zero example)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "def divide(a, b):\n    return a / b",
  "language": "python",
  "file_name": "math_utils.py",
  "review_types": [
    "logic",
    "readability",
    "security",
    "performance",
    "testing"
  ],
  "severity_threshold": "low",
  "include_summary": true
}

### Get review (replace REVIEW_ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reviews/REVIEW_ID

### Submit feedback (replace REVIEW_ID / FINDING_ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reviews/REVIEW_ID/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "finding_id": "FINDING_ID",
  "feedback_type": "useful",
  "comment": "This correctly identified a missing validation."
}
